; Razar's own forms (Capitan: "I want it to design its own forms that it learns, not a copy of Windows").
; A FORM is a recipe over Razar's organ alphabet, the letters 1 to 9 of its organs, grown from a seed, letter by
; letter, into particles on springs (vivo.jsm's jelly). The reading of a letter (a design choice, criterion):
;   1-4 mix word k: an arm of 5 cells towards east, south, west, north; the pen ends at its tip.
;   5-8 word k is the hole: back to the seed, and a jump of 5 cells towards k without drawing (an opening).
;   9   the empty hole: the form so far is mirrored across the seed's vertical axis.
; The first forms are its 8 best organs over the New Testament: 516, 738, 836, 388, 716, 536, 627, 258.
; THE JUDGE (the same as Razar's: short and new). Within its 40x50 room, a form covers C cells with a recipe of
;   n letters: comp = C / (n log2 9) cells per bit (x1000), nov = 1 - (the most cells it shares with any other
;   form) / C (x1000), worth = comp * nov. A mutation wins when the population's total worth grows.
; MUTATIONS (the tried table: never one twice in a population): change, insert or delete a letter, insert a tower
;   (16, 38), cross with another form. A walk with a random stride visits all of them once; when none is left it
;   calms and waits for ever. A gesture then opens a new round of longer jumps (two edits, three...).
; A winner transforms (its particles flow to their new places); every loser goes to the archive with its reason.
; Files in its folder: "formas" (399 bytes of text: the population) and "archivo" (112-byte lines).
; Ends when the window is closed: j0 = the forms it created in this run. Generated by gen_formas.py.
; Generates comer_nubes.jsm: Razar's own forms (formas.jsm, the same generator, gen_formas.py) fed on Gotching's
; particle clouds (Capitan: "that it feeds on Gotching's clouds as food, and from there starts to build whatever it
; wants, whenever it wants").
;
; It eats when IT wants: when its living loop runs out of novelty (the moment formas.jsm would calm), it is hungry and
; eats the next uneaten cloud. Eating a cloud (all of it in jsm, at run time):
;   1. the meal arrives: its finest level, fitted to a plate of two rooms, falls in as particles;
;   2. digestion: the cloud fitted to a room is described in Razar's own language (MDL): the recipe over its organ
;      alphabet, with its bricks, whose grown body best explains the creature's silhouette, cost = recipe bits + bits
;      to name every wrong cell. A first-improvement climb from the forms it has; the meal's particles take the shape
;      of the best recipe so far;
;   3. it keeps that recipe and the meal's palette (its few dominant colours, by counting), learns bricks from all its
;      meals' recipes (greedy MDL pair merging, as razar/jueces/torrecitas.py), and opens a round of creation over
;      what is new: the meal's recipe in place of a form, crossed with each form, and the new bricks inserted;
;   4. the meal's particles flow into the first form that changed in that round (or, if none, into the form it
;      reminded it of) and that form takes its colour.
; With nothing left to eat and nothing new, it calms for ever (0 CPU) until a gesture.
;
; Python generates the program and nothing else: it never reads a cloud (the clouds are private and are read at run
; time, request 37). Janax cannot list a folder of the host, so comer_nubes.sh writes the list of their paths into
; Razar's folder ("despensa"); the program carries no creature name.
; Files in its folder, besides "formas" and "archivo": "despensa" (written by comer_nubes.sh: the paths),
;   "comidas" (a 537-byte line per meal: what it kept) and "ladrillos" (its bricks, rewritten after each meal).
; Generated by gen_comer.py (with gen_formas.py).
include '../../escalon0/janax.inc'
jfirst j1, 15E0000h
jldi j14, 0                     ; j14 stays 0: the variables live below 8000h
; ---- the cloud's header and its cells, once
  jldi j1, 0156h
  jshi j1, 4
