; ---- the meal as a seed: its recipe put in place of the form it reminded it of, and climbed with the population's
;      own judge (the total worth, short and new): the first single op that raises the total is kept, until none
;      does (or the budget). Every step goes to the archive (meal-climb); the top is judged as any candidate: it
;      wins (a form born from the meal) or it is archived with its reason. Then the round of what is new.
;      A tie with the population goes to what it ate (criterion: equal worth leaves the choice free, and the
;      meal is what it wants now), unless that recipe was ever a form: a tie never brings a form back (without
;      this, two meals swapped the same two forms back and forth). In a climb and in every walk, only more wins.
r_eval:                         ; the recipe XSRC as form JF -> JT2 = the population's total with it (nothing kept)
